# Smile at Death: "At the beginning of your upkeep, return up to two target creature cards with power 2 or less from your graveyard
# to the battlefield. Put a +1/+1 counter on each of those creatures." Bot2 Bolts Bot1's Memnite (power 1), Ornithopter (0), Grizzly
# Bears (2, exactly at the limit) and Devilthorn Fox (3, just past it). On turn 9 Bot1's upkeep trigger cannot target the Fox (CR 115.1)
# nor three cards (CR 115.1d); it returns the Memnite and the Bears, each with a +1/+1 counter, as 2/2 and 3/3. The Ornithopter stays.

